# Portfolio project context

Personal portfolio for **Aman Kumar Singh**. React 19 + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind + Framer Motion.

## Deploy paths

- **Live:** `https://kumarsinghaman.github.io/Portfolio/`
- GitHub Pages uses base path `/Portfolio/` (set via `VITE_BASE_PATH` in `.github/workflows/deploy.yml`).
- Never link public files with root-absolute paths like `/resume.pdf`. Use `publicAsset()` from `src/utils/publicAsset.ts`.

## Key commands

```bash
npm run dev              # local dev (base /)
npm run build            # production build
VITE_BASE_PATH=/Portfolio/ npm run build   # match GitHub Pages locally
npm run verify:cursor    # validate hooks, rules, skills
```

## Content & config

- Profile data: `src/data/profile.ts`
- Chat prompt: `src/data/chatPrompt.ts`; API: `api/chat.ts` on Vercel (**API-only** — `vercel.json` skips Vite build; static site is GitHub Pages), env `DEEPSEEK_API_KEY`
- Resume: `public/resume.pdf`

## Agent behavior in this repo

- Match existing dark terminal aesthetic and section patterns.
- Keep diffs minimal; do not refactor unrelated code.
- When fixing bugs: test locally before commit/push (see `test-fixes-before-finalizing.mdc`).
